Maintainer: Meticulous Home <info@meticuloushome.com>
Description: Meticulous Espresso Machine Watcher
 Watcher service for the Meticulous espresso machine.
 Provides system status, log collection and diagnostic archive endpoints.
 Includes a pre-built Python virtual environment with all dependencies.
